  "releaseNotes": "Improves HTTP error diagnostics and client transport behavior.\n      - Adds response status, content type, and raw body details to ToonClientException\n      - Adds Decode<T>() support for structured TOON and JSON error responses\n      - Adds optional request logging for success, failure, and decode paths\n      - Adds automatic response decompression configuration through EnableCompression\n      - Updates DevOp.Toon.Core dependency to 0.1.3",
